              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Itambiro, likalengwa liti likalengesibwa emikono hansi yalyo (ekibunu kyalyo, entebe yalyo) obura, sentimita makumi ataano, n'obugazi sentimita makumi ataano, libe n'omugoma ogurukuhikya sentimita abiri na itaano okulyehinguliriza. Obura bwalyo, bube buti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuruga ha kibunu kyalyo hansi, okuhika hansi ha bunyigita, mita emu, obugazi sentimita makumi ataano, okuruga ha bunyigita okuhika ha bukooto, mita ibiri, obugazi sentimita makumi ataano; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okuruga ha kyoto kyalyo, mita ibiri, kandi okuruga ha kyoto kyalyo ekiturukire haiguru, habeho amahembe ana mita ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyoto eki, kibale embaju ina ezirukwingana, obura mita mukaga, n'obugazi mita mukaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukugiro nagwo, gube gw'embaju ina ezirukwingana, obura mita musanju, obugazi mita musanju, ligire omugoma ogulyehinguliriize, obugazi bwagwo sentimita abiri na itaano, ekibunu kyalyo, sentimita ibiri, okulyehinguliriza lyona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
